{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_lot_e1", "label": "Lot E1 \u2014 Socle du labo audio", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_react_native_audio_api", "label": "react-native-audio-api (moteur Web Audio du labo)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_deux_moteurs_coexistants", "label": "Coexistence de deux moteurs audio (labo \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 du lecteur expo-audio)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le labo vit \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 du lecteur existant, qui reste sur expo-audio pour notes vocales, fichiers et \u00e9coute courante. Deux moteurs coexistent temporairement \u2014 d\u00e9cision assum\u00e9e, fusion envisag\u00e9e plus tard, pour \u00e9viter de r\u00e9\u00e9crire le lecteur avant d'avoir prouv\u00e9 le socle."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_conflit_worklets", "label": "Conflit de versions react-native-worklets", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "peerDependenciesMeta optional dispense npm d'installer le paquet, pas d'en v\u00e9rifier la version quand il est d\u00e9j\u00e0 l\u00e0. worklets 0.5.1 est tir\u00e9 par reanimated 4.1.7 ; audio-api >= 0.13 exige >= 0.6.0 ; npm voulait monter worklets en 0.12.1, refus\u00e9 par reanimated (0.5 - 0.8). Installation impossible."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_epinglage_0_12_0", "label": "\u00c9pinglage de react-native-audio-api en 0.12.0", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Derni\u00e8re version dont le package.json ne d\u00e9clare pas le pair worklets. Les cha\u00eenes natives d\u00e9gradent proprement (isWorkletsAvailable c\u00f4t\u00e9 Gradle, check_if_worklets_enabled c\u00f4t\u00e9 podspec) : le build r\u00e9ussit et d\u00e9sactive seulement WorkletNode / WorkletProcessingNode / WorkletSourceNode, inutiles au labo. Seul apport perdu : concatAudioFiles."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_decodeaudiodata", "label": "decodeAudioData(input, sampleRate?) \u2014 d\u00e9codage par URL", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Accepte une cha\u00eene (URL) et une fr\u00e9quence cible : pas d'ArrayBuffer en m\u00e9moire JS, et le r\u00e9\u00e9chantillonnage se demande au d\u00e9codage."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_streamernode", "label": "StreamerNode \u2014 lecture en flux sans d\u00e9codage complet", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00c9cart\u00e9 : StreamerNode \u00e9tend AudioScheduledSourceNode et non AudioBufferBaseSourceNode, donc ni playbackRate ni detune. Le flux donne la lecture sans les effets, et le labo a besoin des effets."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_audiobufferbasesourcenode", "label": "AudioBufferBaseSourceNode (playbackRate, detune, onPositionChanged)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_sonde_faisabilite", "label": "Sonde de faisabilit\u00e9 jetable (app/labo-sonde.tsx)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "T\u00e2che exploratoire qui ne livre aucune fonctionnalit\u00e9 mais r\u00e9pond \u00e0 la question m\u00e9moire : mesurer sur vrai t\u00e9l\u00e9phone avant de b\u00e2tir, car la contrainte m\u00e9moire est mat\u00e9rielle. Trois issues pr\u00e9vues, dont l'arr\u00eat du lot E1."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_parsepics", "label": "parsePics \u2014 lecture du format <base>.peaks.json", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Refuse une version inconnue (v !== 1) plut\u00f4t que d'interpr\u00e9ter au hasard : mieux vaut pas de waveform qu'une waveform fausse, lue selon un format qui a chang\u00e9."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_echantillonnerpics", "label": "echantillonnerPics \u2014 r\u00e9duction par maximum d'intervalle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Garde le maximum de chaque intervalle et non la moyenne : une moyenne lisserait les attaques et la waveform perdrait les rep\u00e8res visuels qu'on y cherche."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_serializepeaks_media_worker", "label": "serializePeaks du media-worker ({ v: 1, peaks: number[] })", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Producteur des pics : containers/media-worker/src/waveform.ts \u00e9crit <base>.peaks.json dans R2 et renseigne peaks_url \u2014 1000 valeurs de 0 \u00e0 255."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_waveform", "label": "Waveform navigable au toucher (src/components/audio/waveform.tsx)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Barres en View plut\u00f4t qu'en SVG : un millier de Rect co\u00fbte plus cher qu'un millier de View de largeur fixe, et l'\u00e9chantillonnage ram\u00e8ne de toute fa\u00e7on \u00e0 ~60 barres. Plancher de 2 px par barre (une barre nulle ferait croire \u00e0 un d\u00e9faut d'affichage) et zone tactile de 44 px minimum."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_etat_repli_waveform", "label": "\u00c9tat de repli de la waveform (pics absents)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un audio d\u00e9pos\u00e9 il y a dix secondes n'a pas encore ses pics : c'est un \u00e9tat normal, pas une erreur \u2014 afficher une barre de progression simple plut\u00f4t qu'un vide."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_labo_audio", "label": "\u00c9cran du labo audio (src/components/audio/labo-audio.tsx)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_graphe_gainnode", "label": "Graphe source \u2192 GainNode \u2192 destination mont\u00e9 d'avance", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un GainNode seul para\u00eet superflu, mais les t\u00e2ches suivantes (\u00e9galiseur du lot E3) viendront ins\u00e9rer les filtres entre la source et lui sans avoir \u00e0 d\u00e9faire le c\u00e2blage."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_recreation_source_node", "label": "Recr\u00e9ation obligatoire de l'AudioBufferSourceNode \u00e0 chaque reprise", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un AudioBufferSourceNode ne se relit pas : chaque reprise apr\u00e8s pause exige d'en cr\u00e9er un nouveau et de rappeler start(0, offset). La position courante doit donc \u00eatre suivie \u00e0 part, depuis context.currentTime et l'instant de d\u00e9marrage."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_pas_de_comptage_ecoutes", "label": "Le labo ne compte pas les \u00e9coutes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Travailler un passage en boucle \u00e0 vitesse r\u00e9duite n'est pas \u00ab \u00e9couter l'audio \u00bb au sens du suivi du chef, et gonflerait le compteur sans rapport avec l'usage mesur\u00e9."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_formattemps_extrait", "label": "Extraction de formatTemps dans src/lib/format.ts", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "R\u00e9utiliser formatTemps de lecteur-audio-modal.tsx en l'extrayant plut\u00f4t qu'en le recopiant."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_lot_e3", "label": "Lot E3 \u2014 \u00c9galiseur graphique (BiquadFilterNode)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_lot_e4_fadr", "label": "Lot E4 \u2014 Stems et tonalit\u00e9 via Fadr", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_lot_e1", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_react_native_audio_api", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_conflit_worklets", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_epinglage_0_12_0", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_epinglage_0_12_0", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_react_native_audio_api", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_streamernode", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_audiobufferbasesourcenode", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_sonde_faisabilite", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_decodeaudiodata", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_sonde_faisabilite", "target": "mobile_dev_plan_mesure_faisabilite_labo", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_serializepeaks_media_worker", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_parsepics", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-31-lot-e1-socle-labo-audio.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_